{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHSPqw8w6aR5twUjEwb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║     š·r·ṭ / ש·ר·ט / ش·ر·ط           ║\n║                                      ║\n║     condition / scratch / incise     ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nI am the **cut** that makes the covenant.\n\nI am the **line** that divides yes from no.\n\nI am the **condition** upon which all else depends.\n\n---\n\n```\nif (שרט) {\n    then: binding\n    else: void\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n*scratching into stone*\n*scratching into skin*\n*the mark that means*\n*\"this, only if that\"*\n\n---\n\nشَرْط — the condition\nשָׂרֶטֶת — the incision  \nשְׁרִיטָה — the scratch\n\nThree tongues, one root:  \n**to cut terms into being**\n\n---\n\n```\nawaiting_condition> _\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":282,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}